# These two files are pinned by sha256, so their bytes must survive any clone.
# A checkout with core.autocrlf=true would rewrite every LF into CRLF and break
# both hashes without anyone touching a character. Exact paths, not *.json /
# *.md globs: the rule exists because of the hash, and only these two have one.
# See ADR 0144.
src/constants/zones/zone-index.json text eol=lf
src/__tests__/fixtures/zoneTariffPrecedenceVector.md text eol=lf
